{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa Has a Nightmare", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "What Is Feng Shui?", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 8, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "furnishings", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the furniture and other things, such as curtains, in a room ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They believed that their home's surroundings, including its decor and furnishings, can be arranged to promote harmony.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when talking about objects in a bedroom.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "decor", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the way that the inside of a room is decorated", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The decor in your bedroom should be soothing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "headboard", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the upright board at the end of a bed where your head is", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It is a good idea to have a sturdy headboard which protects your head when you are sleeping.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "side table", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a table designed to be placed beside a bed", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Feng Shui suggests that side tables should be lower than your mattress. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "mattress", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the soft part of a bed that you lie on", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The mattress on my bed is huge.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le08ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "What is Feng Shui?", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Feng Shui (pronounced fung shway) is a Chinese way of arranging all objects, including furniture, in a home or building so that good fortune and well-being are present.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Feng Shui states that chi (energy) lives in all things. This energy is made up of two opposite forces, yin (female) and yang (male). There are five elements in Feng Shui: fire, water, metal, earth and wood. A balance must always be present among the elements. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you place furniture and objects with the principles of Feng Shui in mind, you can use a compass (or a bagua) so the objects are in the correct direction.", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Simple Present and Present Continuous ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use Simple Present to talk about facts and healthy habits. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples:<ul><li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">Feng Shui helps us find the ideal place for all of the objects in our home.</span></li><li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">Everything has a certain energy.</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use Present Continuous to talk about temporary activities.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<ul><li><span class=\"italic product-color-text\">More people are practicing Feng Shui in the western world.</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Go on the Internet. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Do some research about Feng Shui. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a list of different ways to Feng Shui your bedroom.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at your list. Do you do any of them?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose 3-4 ways you could Feng Shui your room.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down why you chose them.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Try one of them out.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about Feng Shui.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about different ways to Feng Shui my bedroom.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about my bedroom and objects in it.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "video", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "More people are practicing Feng Shui in the western world. The ancient Chinese began using Feng Shui because they believed that their home's surroundings, including its decor and furnishings, can be arranged to promote harmony. They believe that a home's physical environment has its own energy, or \u201cchi\u201d. When you place objects in the right area, the chi flows and promotes a sense of well-being."}, {"image": "", "time": "21000", "id": 2, "text": "Feng Shui is quite practical. For example, an ideal position for your bed is against a wall where you can see the whole room and the door. In order to feel secure, it is a good idea to have a sturdy headboard which protects your head when you are sleeping."}, {"image": "", "time": "35000", "id": 3, "text": "Also, Feng Shui suggests that side tables should be lower than your mattress. This makes sense because you will not bang your head against the sharp edges of the side table when you are sleeping. Sharp edges next to your head do not promote a restful night's sleep. Feng Shui helps us find the ideal place for all of the objects in our home."}], "video_src": "engenn6le08ob09re2vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about healthy habits.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about rooms and objects in them.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about what people do or what people are doing.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Where is your room? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "What do you do to keep things organized in your room?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Let's learn about a Chinese system of organization!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa reads about Feng Shui. Will she become a Feng Shui <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">practitioner</span>?", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", 